## Description

From November 2025, Anderson Cooper’s report on Anthropic. From December 2025, Sharyn Alfonsi’s report on Character AI. From January 2026, Bill Whitaker’s report on the progress made on AI-powered humanoid robots. From February 2026, Alfonsi’s report on the AI art divide. From March 2026, Lesley Stahl’s report on why lasers, at $3 per shot, may be the next frontier for stopping drone attacks. Also from March 2026, Jon Wertheim’s report on the only active rare earth mine in the U.S. And from May 2026, Cooper’s report on AI-powered, autonomous taxis in London.

Editor's Note: Character AI and Google have agreed to settle several lawsuits with families who say their teens died by suicide or harmed themselves after interacting with the tech platform's chatbots. Neither company admits liability.

